# REACT_APP_GATEWAY_URL is intentionally unset: the UI calls a relative /api.
# Local dev: src/setupProxy.js forwards /api (target: DEV_GATEWAY_URL, default https://localhost:44345).
# Docker: nginx forwards /api. Kubernetes: the ingress forwards /api.
#
# Microsoft Entra ID sign-in for `npm start` (in containers these come from ENTRA_* env vars via config.js).
# Put the real values in .env.local (git-ignored by create-react-app), not here:
#   REACT_APP_ENTRA_TENANT_ID=<directory (tenant) id>
#   REACT_APP_ENTRA_SPA_CLIENT_ID=<SPA app registration client id>
#   REACT_APP_ENTRA_API_SCOPE=api://<API app registration client id>/access_as_user
